":data:`TYPE_ALIASES`），并 支持类型表达式：联合（``str | None``）与泛型嵌套（``list[str]`` / "
"``dict[str, int]``）可组合。可空参数写标准 nullable 形态 ``{type: [string, \"null\"], "
"default: null}`` （Pydantic 侧对应 ``str | None = None``）。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.params:42 of
msgid ""
"桥接（:func:`schema_to_model`）认识的 JSON Schema 关键字子集：``type`` / "
"``description`` / ``default`` / ``enum`` / ``minimum`` / ``maximum`` / "
"``minLength`` / ``maxLength`` / ``pattern`` / ``items`` / ``properties`` "
"——逐关键字映射为 Pydantic 字段约束；超出子集（``oneOf`` / ``anyOf`` / ``$ref`` / ``allOf``"
" 等组合子）在装配期抛 :class:`flowing.errors.FormatError` （fail-fast：出错即刻抛异常、不静默 "
"降级）。"
